        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rocky_Fork_Point%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Rocky Fork stream flows east into Paint Creek, which joins the Scioto River and feeds the Ohio River watershed.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rocky_Fork_Point%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rocky Fork Point lies seven miles east of Hillsboro, the Highland County seat.",
